{
  "name": "Create TikTok Shop product videos with Seedance 2.5 and save them as TikTok drafts via SocialRobot",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create TikTok Shop product videos with Seedance 2.5\n\nTurn product photos and a few true selling points into a 15-second vertical AI product video, then send it to your TikTok inbox as a draft with SocialRobot.\n\n### How it works\n1. A form collects 1-4 product photos, selling points and the language (English or Spanish).\n2. Photos go to Replicate. OpenAI writes a timed script, the Seedance prompt and the caption.\n3. Seedance 2.5 renders a 9:16 720p video with sound. The workflow polls until it is done, failed or timed out.\n4. File size and duration are checked, then SocialRobot sends the video to your TikTok inbox.\n5. Any failure stops the run with a readable message.\n\n### Setup steps\n- [ ] Self-hosted n8n with the SocialRobot community node 3.1+ and your SocialRobot API key\n- [ ] Connect TikTok in SocialRobot and pick the account in **Save TikTok Draft**\n- [ ] Add a Replicate API token (Bearer Auth) to the three Replicate nodes\n- [ ] Add an OpenAI credential\n- [ ] Check model, length and limits in **Set Video Settings**\n\n### Customization\n- Switch to Seedance 2.0 fast or another provider in the video section.\n- Connect **Optional Instagram Reel** to cross-post.\n- SocialRobot does not publish to YouTube.\n\nAbout $3.47 per 15-second video on Replicate at 720p (list price, Oct 2026).",
        "width": 512,
        "height": 1008
      },
      "id": "74783575-5c4a-4f72-9f5f-1a14724cde8c",
      "name": "Template Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
