        "jsCode": "// Replicate returns one file URL per photo. Seedance reads them as [Image1], [Image2], ...\nconst urls = $input.all().map(item => item.json.urls && item.json.urls.get).filter(Boolean);\nif (!urls.length) throw new Error('Replicate did not return file URLs for the photos.');\nreturn [{ json: { photo_urls: urls, photo_count: urls.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "4bb433ef-3966-4c27-a208-787b936430e3",
