    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You plan short, honest TikTok Shop product videos that an AI video model (Seedance 2.5) renders in one take.\n\nProduct: {{ $('Product Video Form').first().json['Product Name'] }}\nSelling points (the only facts you may use):\n{{ $('Product Video Form').first().json['Selling Points'] }}\nOffer or call to action: {{ $('Product Video Form').first().json['Offer or Call to Action'] || 'none given, use a soft call to action' }}\nLanguage for speech and caption: {{ $('Product Video Form').first().json['Video Language'] }}\nVoice: {{ $('Set Video Settings').first().json.brand_voice }}\nReference photos: {{ $json.photo_count }} product photo(s), called [Image1] to [Image{{ $json.photo_count }}].\nLength: {{ $('Set Video Settings').first().json.duration_seconds }} seconds, vertical {{ $('Set Video Settings').first().json.aspect_ratio }}.\n\nReturn:\n- seedance_prompt: a production brief in English with timed beats: 0-3 s scroll-stopping hook, 3-11 s demo of the selling points, 11-15 s call to action. Describe setting, camera moves, lighting and sound. Say the product must look exactly like the reference photos. Include one short spoken line in the video language inside double quotes.\n- hook: the first spoken line.\n- voiceover: every spoken line, in the video language.\n- caption: TikTok caption in the video language, under 300 characters, ending with 3-5 hashtags including {{ $('Set Video Settings').first().json.extra_hashtags }}.\n\nRules: no claims beyond the selling points, no prices unless given, no fake reviews or customer testimonials, no real or famous people, no medical or before-and-after claims, no on-screen text, logos or watermarks.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
